cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata in this file."
title: "whisper-transcribe-de"
abstract: >-
  A command-line tool for reproducible German speech transcription of audio and video,
  built on WhisperX. A curated domain vocabulary adapts recognition to any subject area.
  It supports word-level timestamps and reproducibility metadata, and runs locally without
  cloud APIs.
type: software
authors:
